    createStaticVNode('<h1 id="innovation" tabindex="-1">Innovation <a class="header-anchor" href="#innovation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Innovation&quot;">​</a></h1><p>This page describes where zkde.fi is distinct in practice, not just in narrative.</p><h2 id="the-problem-this-solves" tabindex="-1">The Problem This Solves <a class="header-anchor" href="#the-problem-this-solves" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;The Problem This Solves&quot;">​</a></h2><p>“Autonomous DeFi” claims are common, but many systems fail to provide clear boundaries between execution control, privacy posture, and verifiability.</p><h2 id="why-this-matters" tabindex="-1">Why This Matters <a class="header-anchor" href="#why-this-matters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Why This Matters&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Users need usable controls, and integrators need deterministic integration surfaces. Innovation is meaningful only if it changes operational outcomes.</p><h2 id="distinguishing-characteristics" tabindex="-1">Distinguishing Characteristics <a class="header-anchor" href="#distinguishing-characteristics" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Distinguishing Characteristics&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="surface-based-execution-model" tabindex="-1">Surface-based execution model <a class="header-anchor" href="#surface-based-execution-model" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Surface-based execution model&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The app uses explicit operating surfaces (<code>vault</code>, <code>trade</code>, <code>brain</code>) instead of a fragmented tab sprawl.</p><h3 id="flow-specific-verification" tabindex="-1">Flow-specific verification <a class="header-anchor" href="#flow-specific-verification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Flow-specific verification&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Verification behavior is route-aware (strict-gated, advisory, or wallet-first with reconciliation) rather than treated as a single rigid mode.</p><h3 id="trust-composition" tabindex="-1">Trust composition <a class="header-anchor" href="#trust-composition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Trust composition&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Profile and passport views consolidate trust posture into actionable context for users and integrators.</p><h3 id="selective-disclosure-focus" tabindex="-1">Selective disclosure focus <a class="header-anchor" href="#selective-disclosure-focus" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Selective disclosure focus&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Disclosure workflows are designed to support bounded claims without forcing full strategy transparency.</p><h2 id="innovation-map" tabindex="-1">Innovation Map <a class="header-anchor" href="#innovation-map" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Innovation Map&quot;">​</a></h2><div class="language-mermaid vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">mermaid</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">flowchart TB</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  S[Surface model] --&gt; O[Operational clarity]</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  V[Flow-specific verification] --&gt; O</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  P[Passport composition] --&gt; O</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  D[Selective disclosure] --&gt; O</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  O --&gt; R[Better user and integrator outcomes]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Next: <a href="/docs/architecture-summary.html">Architecture summary</a> | <a href="/docs/aegis.html">AEGIS-1</a> | <a href="/docs/api-overview.html">API overview</a></p>', 18)
